From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bump fast-uri 3.1.9 and body-parser 2.4.0 for CVEs

Upstream: https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/releases/tag/v3.1.9
Upstream: https://github.com/expressjs/body-parser/releases/tag/2.4.0

Bumps vendored fast-uri 3.1.8 -> 3.1.9 (CVE-2026-110306, CVE-2026-110180,
CVE-2026-110095, CVE-2026-110725) and body-parser 2.2.1 -> 2.4.0
(CVE-2026-111181). Generated against Grafana 13.1.8 post-Patch25
(storybook/follow-redirects) lockfile.
